            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verwende <code>===</code>, um eine Bedingung zu codieren, die den Text anzeigt, wenn <code>flightModeOn</code><code>true</code> ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flightModeOn = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(flightModeOn === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Turn flight mode off to connect to the internet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"49\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Turn flight mode off to connect to the internet\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>flightModeOn === true</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
